  background-color: #f0f0f0;
  padding: 20px;
}

h1 {
  color: blue;
}
```
Using the concepts of the DOM and CSS selectors, analyze how the styles are applied to the elements in the document.
3. Write a CSS rule that targets all elements with the class `header` and sets their font size to 24px. Suppose we also have a rule with the selector `h1`, which sets the font size to 18px. Which rule will take precedence, and why?
4. Suppose we have an HTML document with the following structure:
```html
